  "elements": [
    {
      "id": "uuQR4cCuTN_87tLFxD_EH",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1147.6644950853556,
      "y": -45.328185904133534,
      "width": 285.66796874999994,
      "height": 90,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "a0",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 239789917,
      "version": 176,
      "versionNonce": 1536876250,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1742491106000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Design Lyft for\ndeaf drivers",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Design Lyft for deaf drivers",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "JZmsMk9SBny0VENhPPdT9",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 300.22017969354044,
      "y": 209.10590149763544,
      "width": 352.45703125,
      "height": 750,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "a1",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 588447485,
      "version": 833,
      "versionNonce": 183785158,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1742491095200,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Functional Requirements:\n\n0. Special considerations\n    a. Speech to text\n        i. User calls\n        ii. Support calls\n    b. Notification with vibration or\nflashes \n    c. User send special instructions\n        - I am wearing a red shirt\n    d. Real time chat \n\n\n1. Car pool service for deaf drivers\n2. Request matching\n    I. Customers put a request\n        a. source\n        b. destination\n        II. Drivers would be shown\nthe request\n4. Only one driver should accept a\nrequest\n5. User cancel the booking\n\nOptional:\n1. Notifications\n2. Payment\n3. Driver management \n4. Auth\n5. User management",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Functional Requirements:\n\n0. Special considerations\n    a. Speech to text\n        i. User calls\n        ii. Support calls\n    b. Notification with vibration or flashes \n    c. User send special instructions \n        - I am wearing a red shirt\n    d. Real time chat \n\n\n1. Car pool service for deaf drivers\n2. Request matching\n    I. Customers put a request\n        a. source\n        b. destination\n        II. Drivers would be shown the request\n4. Only one driver should accept a request\n5. User cancel the booking\n\nOptional:\n1. Notifications\n2. Payment\n3. Driver management \n4. Auth\n5. User management",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "5C1gy-rdsAj_PxDIsg14r",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 305.0021806694809,
      "y": 1045.4838840581644,
      "width": 301.58174361156426,
      "height": 150,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "a2",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1217110077,
      "version": 155,
      "versionNonce": 1915675718,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1742491096733,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Non functional Requirement:\n\n1. High availability\n2. Consistency\n3. Scalable\n4. Performant -> Low latency",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Non functional Requirement:\n\n1. High availability\n2. Consistency\n3. Scalable\n4. Performant -> Low latency",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "TIWBh52GFUx5kMNDCahl7",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 959.4512870342654,
      "y": 191.55825486371697,
      "width": 347.1413914523482,
      "height": 800,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "a3",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1218166941,
      "version": 613,
      "versionNonce": 936146822,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1742491472024,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Back of the envelope calc:\n\n1. API \n100M DAU\n\nwrites:\n200M requests -> user\n200M accepts -> drivers\n\nwrites -> 400M/86400 -> 4k rps\n4k * 5 -> 20k rps\n\nreads:\n1 : 10 -> 2k rps \n2k * 5 -> 10K rps\n\n2. Storage\n\nDriver\ni. driverId\nii. currentLocation\nUser\nTrip\n\n100 B * 100M users -> 1GB\n100 B * 200M requests -> 2GB\n100 B * 1M drivers -> 100MB\n100 B * 200M -> 2GB\n\n10 years \n~ 10GB * 365 * 10 ~ 30 TB\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Back of the envelope calc:\n\n1. API \n100M DAU\n\nwrites:\n200M requests -> user\n200M accepts -> drivers\n\nwrites -> 400M/86400 -> 4k rps\n4k * 5 -> 20k rps\n\nreads:\n1 : 10 -> 2k rps \n2k * 5 -> 10K rps\n\n2. Storage\n\nDriver\ni. driverId\nii. currentLocation\nUser\nTrip\n\n100 B * 100M users -> 1GB\n100 B * 200M requests -> 2GB\n100 B * 1M drivers -> 100MB\n100 B * 200M -> 2GB\n\n10 years \n~ 10GB * 365 * 10 ~ 30 TB\n",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "mMOLJ1zj8pTLvwYFkt5nI",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1495.2278767387388,
      "y": 169.9682591364131,
      "width": 458.12773675515655,
      "height": 850,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "a4",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1317499261,
      "version": 497,
      "versionNonce": 1737295110,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1742491088516,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "DB Schema:\n\ni. User\nuserId: UUID\nname: varchar(100)\ndob: timestamp\ncreatedAt: timestamp\nupdadatedAt: timestamp\nisActive: boolean\n\nii. Driver\ndriverId: UUID\nname: varchar(100)\ndob: timestamp\ncreatedAt: timestamp\nupdadatedAt: timestamp\nisActive: boolean\n\niii. Vehicle\nvehicleId: UUID\ndriverId: UUID\nregistNo\nmodelNo\n\niv. Trip\ntripId: UUID\nsource\ndestination\nuserId\ndriverId\ntripStatus: TripStatus (Requested,\nSTARTED, COMPLETED, IN_PROGRESS,\nCANCELLED)\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "DB Schema:\n\ni. User\nuserId: UUID\nname: varchar(100)\ndob: timestamp\ncreatedAt: timestamp\nupdadatedAt: timestamp\nisActive: boolean\n\nii. Driver\ndriverId: UUID\nname: varchar(100)\ndob: timestamp\ncreatedAt: timestamp\nupdadatedAt: timestamp\nisActive: boolean\n\niii. Vehicle\nvehicleId: UUID\ndriverId: UUID\nregistNo\nmodelNo\n\niv. Trip\ntripId: UUID\nsource\ndestination\nuserId\ndriverId\ntripStatus: TripStatus (Requested, STARTED, COMPLETED, IN_PROGRESS, CANCELLED)\n",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "0IqunsU7ZsvTmtR7u7YAK",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2188.4933716809664,
      "y": 114.29475360966478,
      "width": 606.6481484704632,
      "height": 1000,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "a5",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 186485651,
      "version": 798,
      "versionNonce": 124385734,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1742491087317,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Core APIs:\n\nUser:\n\n1. POST /api/v1/user/trip\nReq.body -> {\n    \"source\": \"lat, long\"\n    \"destination\": \"lat, long\",\n    \"currentLocation\": \"lat, long\",\n    \"requestedAt\": timestamp\n}\n\nResponse -> 201: Accepted {\n       \"message\": \"\",\n        \"tripId\": \"\",\n        \"estimatedFare\": 1000\n}\n\n2. GET /api/v1/user/trip/{tripId}\n{\n    \"status\": \"started\" | \"in progress\",\n    \"driver\": {\n        \"location\": \"\",\n        \"driverId\": \"\"\n    }\n}\n\n3. PUT /api/v1/user/trip/{tripId}/cancel\n{\n    \"status\": \"cancelled\"\n}\n\nDriver:\n\n4. PUT /api/v1/driver/trip/{tripId}\n{\n    \"requestType\": \"accept\" | \"reject\"\n}\n\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Core APIs:\n\nUser:\n\n1. POST /api/v1/user/trip\nReq.body -> {\n    \"source\": \"lat, long\"\n    \"destination\": \"lat, long\",\n    \"currentLocation\": \"lat, long\",\n    \"requestedAt\": timestamp\n}\n\nResponse -> 201: Accepted {\n       \"message\": \"\",\n        \"tripId\": \"\",\n        \"estimatedFare\": 1000\n}\n\n2. GET /api/v1/user/trip/{tripId}\n{\n    \"status\": \"started\" | \"in progress\",\n    \"driver\": {\n        \"location\": \"\",\n        \"driverId\": \"\"\n    }\n}\n\n3. PUT /api/v1/user/trip/{tripId}/cancel\n{\n    \"status\": \"cancelled\"\n}\n\nDriver:\n\n4. PUT /api/v1/driver/trip/{tripId}\n{\n    \"requestType\": \"accept\" | \"reject\"\n}\n\n",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
